 panal de abejas, el rat\u00f3n ofrece un buen agarre y un manejo sin esfuerzos en todo momento.","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/195\/82499\/51600577\/bg\/raton-gaming-sharkoon-light2-180-rgb-negro.jpg","wholesale_price":"26.71","unit_price_tax":30.3042},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4044951031085"],"reference":"GA01312242","name":{"1":"RATON GAMING SHARKOON LIGHT2 180 RGB NEGRO","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Podemos considerar el Light\u00b2 180 como uno de los ratones m\u00e1s ligeros en el mundo, con tan solo un peso de 63 gramos y siendo de esta manera especialmente f\u00e1cil de usar. Con tres pies de rat\u00f3n fabricados 100 % en PTFE as\u00ed como el cable ultraflexible, se desliza sin restricciones sobre las superficies con particular suavidad. El potente sensor PixArt PMW3360 con hasta 12.000 DPI permite realizar maniobras particularmente precisas. Tambi\u00e9n, gracias a su dise\u00f1o sim\u00e9trico combinado con la cubierta superior con estructura de panal de abejas, el rat\u00f3n ofrece un buen agarre y un manejo sin esfuerzos en todo momento.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"\u00d3ptico, PixArt 3360, 12000dpi, 1000Hz, DPI indicador LED, USB, 6 botones, RGB, cable 180cm, 63g","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"Sharkoon","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":30.3042,"unit_price_tax":30.3042,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Perif\u00e9ricos","brand":"Sharkoon","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/195\/82499\/51600577\/bg\/raton-gaming-sharkoon-light2-180-rgb-negro.jpg"],"wholesale_price":26.71}}},"5901969426830":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["5901969426830",false],"wholesale_price":[7.8