rtical dentro de las cajas compactas micro-ATX MS-Y1000 y MS-Z1000. Esta nueva orientaci\u00f3n pone en primer plano el dise\u00f1o visual de la tarjeta gr\u00e1fica. Instalar el soporte es especialmente f\u00e1cil y no requiere accesorios adicionales. El soporte se instala en pocos minutos y la tarjeta gr\u00e1fica se conecta a la placa base mediante el cable elevador. Gracias a la moderna especificaci\u00f3n PCIe 4.0, los datos tambi\u00e9n se transmiten a una velocidad s\u00faper r\u00e1pida de 252 Gbit\/s.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"Compact VGC Kit 4.0, soporte de tarjeta gr\u00e1fica (metal), cable elevador PCIe 4.0 x16, s\u00f3lo compatible con cajas serie MS-Y1000\/MS-Z1000, 252 Gbit\/s, cable 11,5 cm","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"Sharkoon","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":44.1456,"unit_price_tax":44.1456,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables y Conectores","brand":"Sharkoon","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/5916\/90105\/64202206\/bg\/kit-montaje-vga-vertical-sharkoon-vgc-4-0-para-cajas-ms-y-z1000.jpg"],"wholesale_price":40.28}}},"4044951037124":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4044951037124",false],"wholesale_price":[42.13,false],"price":[46.0326,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:187421","Cat. IDs: 122","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 122","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/4b0953204fcfa1a7c1f168da0fbc75d9.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"reference":"CJ12312029","unit_price":46.0326,"category":"Cables y Conectores","brand":"Sharkoon","name_pt":"KIT MONTAJE VERTICAL AGC 4.0 SHARKOON PARA ELITE SHARK CA Y TG7M RGB","quantity":0,"ean13":"4044951037124","description_short_pt":"VGC Kit 4.0, soporte de tarjeta gr\u00e1fica (metal), cable elevador PCIe 4.0 x16, s\u00f3lo compatible con cajas serie Elite Shark CA200G, CA200M, CA300T, CA300H, CA700 y TG7M RGB, 252 Gbit\/s, cable 25 cm","description_pt":"Con el Vertical Graphics Card Kit 4.0 de Sharkoon, tu tarjeta gr\u00e1fica recibir\u00e1 la atenci\u00f3n que merece. El kit permite instalar una tarjeta gr\u00e1fica de forma vertical para que se vea su estiloso dise\u00f1o dentro de la caja para PC. Se puede instalar en unos pocos pasos para que empiece el espect\u00e1culo cuanto antes. As\u00ed pues, el kit incluye un cable elevador PCIe 4.0 de alta calidad que sirve para conectar la tarjeta gr\u00e1fica con la placa base. El m\u00e1ximo rendimiento est\u00e1 m\u00e1s que asegurado gracias a la velocidad de transferencia especialmente alta de hasta 252 Gbit\/s. S\u00f3lo compatible con cajas serie Elite Shark CA200G, CA200M, CA300T, CA300H, CA700 y TG7M RGB.","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/5916\/90106\/64201484\/bg\/kit-montaje-vertical-agc-4-0-sharkoon-para-elite-shark-ca-y-tg7m-rgb.jpg","wholesale_price":"42.13","unit_price_tax":46.0326},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4044951037124"],"reference":"CJ12312029","name":{"1":"KIT MONTAJE VERTICAL AGC 4.0 SHARKOON PARA ELITE SHARK CA Y TG7M RGB","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Con el Vertical Graphics Card Kit 4.0 de Sharkoon, tu tarjeta gr\u00e1fica recibir\u00e1 la atenci\u00f3n que merece. El kit permite instalar una tarjeta gr\u00e1fica de forma vertical para que se vea su estiloso dise\u00f1o dentro de la caja para PC. Se puede instalar en unos poco