mpiar cada habitaci\u00f3n.Elige uno de sus 10 modos de limpieza a trav\u00e9s de la APP y ajusta la limpieza de la Conga a cada una de tus necesidades (limpiar el recibidor, fregar el ba\u00f1o, limpiar la cocina, limpiar una habitaci\u00f3n, aspirar el comedor, limpiar un punto espec\u00edfico, etc).Movimiento vaiv\u00e9n de fregado electr\u00f3nico.Movimiento vaiv\u00e9n de fregado intensivo con control electr\u00f3nico de dosificaci\u00f3n de agua que desincrustar\u00e1 hasta la suciedad m\u00e1s complicada.Olv\u00eddate de limpiar.Disfruta de la comodidad de una limpieza completa sin ocuparte de nada.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"Conga 8290 Immortal Ultra Power Home X-Treme Robot aspirador con navegaci\u00f3n l\u00e1ser y base de autovaciado, 3 L, 280 min, 7000 Pa","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"Cecotec","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":213.4146,"unit_price_tax":213.4146,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza","brand":"Cecotec","quantity":5,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/2588\/104605\/82142297\/bg\/conga-8290-immortal-ultra-power-home-x-treme.jpg"],"wholesale_price":206.23}}},"8435484084246":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435484084246",false],"wholesale_price":[88.9,false],"price":[93.738,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:187801","Cat. IDs: 145","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 145","Deleted old images","New images creat