y Link Lite, que incluyen una nueva tecnolog\u00eda que permite una conexi\u00f3n entre ellos r\u00e1pida, sin necesidad de cables, manteniendo as\u00ed limpio el interior de la caja y el montaje. Pudiendo integrar hasta un total de diez, logrando un gran caudal de aire. Mant\u00e9n tus componentes fr\u00edos, rindiendo de la manera m\u00e1s eficiente.Podr\u00e1s instalar hasta diez ventiladores de 120 mm, uno en la parte trasera, tres en la zona lateral, tres en zona superior y tres en la zona inferior. Crea la iluminaci\u00f3n perfecta para tu setup con el mando a distancia ARGB que incluye este chasis.M\u00daLTIPLES PRESTACIONESNox Hummer Astra es compatible con los formatos ATX, ITX y Micro ATX. Tambi\u00e9n admite m\u00faltiples combinaciones de hasta cinco discos duros: podr\u00e1s instalar 2 x 3.5 y 3 x 2.5\".","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"Semitorre, ATX \/ M-ATX, 2 x 3.5\" \u00f3 3 x 2.5\", 3x 2.5\", CPU cooler: 160 mm, VGA: 420 mm, Chasis de acero SPCC 0.8 y 0.6 mm, Blanco","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"NOX","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":96.2268,"unit_price_tax":96.2268,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cajas y fuentes","brand":"NOX","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/237\/91989\/70935639\/bg\/caja-nox-miditorre-deluxe-hummer-astra-blanca.jpg"],"wholesale_price":91.34}}},"6941921147747":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["6941921147747",false],"wholesale_price":[32.03,false],"price":[35.7306,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",