uct without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:189438","Cat. IDs: 145","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 145","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/3cbcd0befd83a4acd1f86651de74e04e.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"reference":"HO02330131","unit_price":119.1666,"category":"Limpieza","brand":"Cecotec","name_pt":"ROBOT ASPIRADOR CECOTEC CONGA FLASH CONNECTED ULTIMATE","quantity":0,"ean13":"8435484057950","description_short_pt":"2100 Pa,  160 m, 6 programas. APP, Asistente Virtual Alexa, 4 in 1, iTech Smart 2.0, 64 dB, GPS Home, Ion-Litio de 14,4 V y 2600 mAh, 2 cepillos","description_pt":"Robot aspirador Conga Flash Connected Ultimate con tecnolog\u00eda random. 160 minutos de autonom\u00eda. Potencia de succi\u00f3n de 2100 Pa. 3 niveles de potencia y de fregado. Cepillo Jalisco. 6 programas. APP. Asistente Virtual Alexa. Programaci\u00f3n.4 in 1: aspira, barre, pasa la mopa y friega.APP Control: aplicaci\u00f3n para smartphone con la que podr\u00e1s controlar tu robot seleccionando los modos de limpieza, programando la limpieza, seleccionando el nivel de potencia de succi\u00f3n y de fregado y observar el historial de limpiezas.Conecta el robot al  asistente virtual de control por voz Alexa. Podr\u00e1s realizar varios controles por voz, tales como, empezar la limpieza, parar de limpiar, mandar el robot a su base de carga o incluso localizar el robot por medio de emisiones auditivas. Cepillo Jalisco cepillo para suelos duros que con su tecnolog\u00eda de microfibras captura el polvo, arena, \u00e1caros, pelusa? de forma eficiente, ya que aspira el triple de suciedad en una s\u00f3la pasada*. Fregado inteligente con la tecnolog\u00eda iWater. Experimenta un control absoluto con los 3 niveles de fregado apto para todo tipo de superficies.\u00a1Friega por ti! Su sistema Wash4You pasa la mopa y friega con solo ponerle el dep\u00f3sito de l\u00edquidos. Limpia de forma inteligente los m\u00e1ximos metros mediante su avanzado sistema de control electr\u00f3nico que dosifica y distribuye el agua de forma homog\u00e9nea por la mopa.Sistema Turbo Clean Carpet especial para alfombras, para limpiarlas de la forma m\u00e1s eficaz.Sistema ForceClean: potente turbina que maximiza la gran potencia de succi\u00f3n hasta 2100 Pa. Recoge todo tipo de suciedad y garantiza un suelo siempre limpio.3 niveles de potencia: modo Eco para limpiezas superficiales con el m\u00ednimo consumo, modo Normal para limpiezas diarias y modo Turbo para limpiezas en profundidad.6 modos de limpieza seleccionables: Auto, Bordes, Manual, Habitaci\u00f3n, Espiral y Vuelta a casa.Tecnolog\u00eda iTech Smart 2.0 para una navegaci\u00f3n inteligente y con sensores de proximidad, antichoque y antica\u00edda.Mopa Twin Floor de dos materiales para realizar una limpieza profesional en todo tipo de superficies.Tecnolog\u00eda OnlySilence para una limpieza silenciosa con un nivel sonoro de All-TimeTable Pro: programable 24 horas al d\u00eda durante los 7 d\u00edas de la semana.El robot aspirador vuelve autom\u00e1ticamente a la base de carga al finalizar la bater\u00eda gracias a su sistema GPS Home.Bater\u00eda de Ion-Litio de 14,4 V y 2600 mAh. Disfruta de una autonom\u00eda de hasta 160 minutos**.Purifica el aire con el filtro de alta eficiencia capaz de retener al\u00e9rgenos y polvo.Dep\u00f3sito mixto para s\u00f3lidos y l\u00edquidos de gran capacidadSe adapta totalmente a tu hogar, limpia debajo de los muebles, detecta obst\u00e1culos y evita caerse por las escaleras.Llega a todos los rincones con sus 2 cepillos laterales que ayudan a empujar toda la suciedad hasta la boquilla.*Pruebas en laboratorio realizadas con arena dolom\u00edtica de acuerdo con el est\u00e1ndar IEC 60312-1:2010.**En condiciones \u00f3ptimas de limpieza: suelos duros con poco rozamiento y cantidad moderada de obst\u00e1culos.","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/2588\/95293\/72294947\/bg\/robot-aspirador-cecotec-conga-flash-connected-ultimate.jpg","wholesale_price":"113.83","unit_price_tax":119.1666},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435484057950"],"reference":"HO02330131","name":{"1":"ROBOT ASPIRADOR CECOTEC CONGA FLASH CONNECTED ULTIMATE","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Robot aspirador Conga Flash Connected Ultimate con tecnolog\u00eda random. 160 minutos de autonom\u00eda. Potencia de succi\u00f3n de 2100 Pa. 3 niveles de potencia y de fregado. Cepillo Jalisco. 6 programas. APP. Asistente Virtual Alexa. Programaci\u00f3n.4 in 1: aspira, barre, pasa la mopa y friega.APP Control: aplicaci\u00f3n para smartphone con la que podr\u00e1s controlar tu robot seleccionando los modos de limpieza, programando la limpieza, seleccionando el nivel de potencia de succi\u00f3n y de fregado y observar el historial de limpiezas.Conecta el robot al  asistente virtual de control por voz Alexa. Podr\u00e1s realizar varios controles por voz, tales como, empezar la limpieza, parar de limpiar, mandar el robot a su base de carga o incluso localizar el robot por medio de emisiones auditivas. Cepillo Jalisco cepillo para suelos duros que con su tecnolog\u00eda de microfibras captura el polvo, arena, \u00e1caros, pelusa? de forma eficiente, ya que aspira el triple de suciedad en una s\u00f3la pasada*. Fregado inteligente con la tecnolog\u00eda iWater. Experimenta un control absoluto con los 3 niveles de fregado apto para todo tipo de superficies.\u00a1Friega por ti! Su sistema Wash4You pasa la mopa y friega con solo ponerle el dep\u00f3sito de l\u00edquidos. Limpia de forma inteligente los m\u00e1ximos metros mediante su avanzado sistema de control electr\u00f3nico que dosifica y distribuye el agua de forma homog\u00e9nea por la mopa.Sistema Turbo Clean Carpet especial para alfombras, para limpiarlas de la forma m\u00e1s eficaz.Sistema ForceClean: potente turbina que maximiza la gran potencia de succi\u00f3n hasta 2100 Pa. Recoge todo tipo de suciedad y garantiza un suelo siempre limpio.3 niveles de potencia: modo Eco para limpiezas superficiales con el m\u00ednimo consumo, modo Normal para limpiezas diarias y modo Turbo para limpiezas en profundidad.6 modos de limpieza seleccionables: Auto, Bordes, Manual, Habitaci\u00f3n, Espiral y Vuelta a casa.Tecnolog\u00eda iTech Smart 2.0 para una navegaci\u00f3n inteligente y con sensores de proximidad, antichoque y antica\u00edda.Mopa Twin Floor de dos materiales para realizar una limpieza profesional en todo tipo de superficies.Tecnolog\u00eda OnlySilence para una limpieza silenciosa con un nivel sonoro de All-TimeTable Pro: programable 24 horas al d\u00eda durante los 7 d\u00edas de la semana.El robot aspirador vuelve autom\u00e1ticamente a la base de carga al finalizar la bater\u00eda gracias a su sistema GPS Home.Bater\u00eda de Ion-Litio de 14,4 V y 2600 mAh. Disfruta de una autonom\u00eda de hasta 160 minutos**.Purifica el aire con el filtro de alta eficiencia capaz de retener al\u00e9rgenos y polvo.Dep\u00f3sito mixto para s\u00f3lidos y l\u00edquidos de gran capacidadSe adapta totalmente a tu hogar, limpia debajo de los muebles, detecta obst\u00e1culos y evita caerse por las escaleras.Llega a todos los rincones con sus 2 cepillos laterales que ayudan a empujar toda la suciedad hasta la boquilla.*Pruebas en laboratorio realizadas con arena dolom\u00edtica de acuerdo con el est\u00e1ndar IEC 60312-1:2010.**En condiciones \u00f3ptimas de limpieza: suelos duros con poco rozamiento y cantidad moderada de obst\u00e1culos.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"2100 Pa,  160 m, 6 programas. APP, Asistente Virtual Alexa, 4 in 1, iTech Smart 2.0, 64 dB, GPS Home, Ion-Litio de 14,4 V y 2600 mAh, 2 cepillos","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"Cecotec","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":119.1666,"unit_price_tax":119.1666,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza","brand":"Cecotec","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/2588\/95293\/72294947\/bg\/robot-aspirador-cecotec-conga-flash-connected-ultimate.jpg"],"wholesale_price":113.83}}},"8435484057707":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435484057707",false],"wholesale_price":[142.88,false],"price":[148.7976,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:189439","Cat. IDs: 145","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 145","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/285e2f4b4ba0d68cf934dd85a179e621.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"reference":"HO02330132","unit_price":148.7976,"category":"Limpieza","brand":"Cecotec","name_pt":"ASPIRADOR ESCOBA CECOTEC CONGA ROCKSTAR 1700 TITANIUM ERGOWET","quantity":0,"ean13":"8435484057707","description_short_pt":"Conga Rockstar 1700 Titanium ErgoWet, 680W, 230 AW, 90 min, 3 kg, 3000 mAh, 0.6L, 88dB, 2h, 29.6V","description_pt":"Atrapa todo tipo de suciedadJaliscazo, el cepillo m\u00e1s letal26 kPa para arrasar con la suciedadUltrapotencia controladaErgoFlex: m\u00e1xima comodidad con un gestoHasta 75 min de autonom\u00eda\u00b3Motor Digital Brushless4 modos, resultados \u00fanicosAspira y retiene la suciedadDep\u00f3sito de gran capacidad4-in-1 cordless vacuum cleaner: upright, broom, handheld and floor scrubber with digital Brushless motor, maximum suction power and 360 design to remove dust from anywhere. - Typhoon system that maximizes its impressive suction power up to 230 aW\u00b9, to vacuum any type of dirt.- Digital Brushless technology with a state-of-the-art brushless digital motor, to provide higher speed, less noise and extend the life of the vacuum cleaner. - ForceSonic technology with a maximum power of 680 W. Vacuums all kinds of dirt and keeps your home always clean by maximizing its 26 kPa of suction pressure\u00b2.- It has a digital screen where you can see the remaining battery percentage, select the different modes, alerts and recommendations. And you can also view the suction level in each mode. - The Smart Auto Mode is included, which intelligently manages the suction power by adapting to the type of brush, surface (hard floor or carpet) and amount of dirt. Using sensors and automatically, the vacuum cleaner detects the appropriate power in each situation.- Guarantee maximum efficiency with the Multiphasic System.- With its ErgoFlex system it adapts to any circumstance. Thanks to its flexible tube you can access any corner. In addition, you can scrub your home thanks to the WaterTank accessory.- 2500 mAh and 29.6 V Lithium-Ion battery that achieves a range of up to 75 minutes\u00b3. You can vacuum your entire house without having to recharge it.- Four operating modes, Eco, Medium, Turbo and Auto, to adapt its use to each circumstance. The Eco mode extends the battery to the maximum with impeccable results, the Normal mode provides the best combination between efficiency and suction power, the Turbo mode kills the most difficult dirt and vacuums carpets. And the Auto mode, detects the amount of dirt that each place in your home has and adapts the suction to the amount of dirt.- Effective definitive brush against any soil and dirt. It combines three technologies: Microfibers that capture minute particles, Silicone that traps long hairs, and dragging blades to thoroughly clean carpets.- 360\u00ba technology to reach all corners of the home, even the highest. The weight falls on the fist to be able to lift the vacuum cleaner comfortably.- Maximum efficiency throughout its entire useful life thanks to Cyclonic System technology. It incorporates the latest advances in suction to separate the particles by centrifugal force.- High performance double filtering. The intake filter captures dirt and the exhaust filter retains tiny allergens to purify the air. - Large 600 ml capacity tank to vacuum the entire home.- Sound level of only 88 dB, much less than any other vacuum cleaner with similar power, so that it does not interrupt any moment of the day.- Designed to clean all types of surfaces, both soft and hard. - LED marker that shows the remaining battery and allows you to optimize cleaning to the maximum. - Thanks to its light weight of 3 kg you can move it freely and easily. - Includes 2 narrow and wide 2-in-1 accessories for furniture and corners.- 1.According to tests carried out in accordance with clause 5.8 of the IEC 62885-4:2020 standard.- 2.According to Cecotec internal tests.- 3.In Eco mode with the use of a non-motorized accessory.","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/1872\/95294\/72294441\/bg\/aspirador-escoba-cecotec-conga-rockstar-1700-titanium-ergowet.jpg","wholesale_price":"142.88","unit_price_tax":148.7976},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435484057707"],"reference":"HO02330132","name":{"1":"ASPIRADOR ESCOBA CECOTEC CONGA ROCKSTAR 1700 TITANIUM ERGOWET","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Atrapa todo tipo de suciedadJaliscazo, el cepillo m\u00e1s letal26 kPa para arrasar con la suciedadUltrapotencia controladaErgoFlex: m\u00e1xima comodidad con un gestoHasta 75 min de autonom\u00eda\u00b3Motor Digital Brushless4 modos, resultados \u00fanicosAspira y retiene la suciedadDep\u00f3sito de gran capacidad4-in-1 cordless vacuum cleaner: upright, broom, handheld and floor scrubber with digital Brushless motor, maximum suction power and 360 design to remove dust from anywhere. - Typhoon system that maximizes its impressive suction power up to 230 aW\u00b9, to vacuum any type of dirt.- Digital Brushless technology with a state-of-the-art brushless digital motor, to provide higher speed, less noise and extend the life of the vacuum cleaner. - ForceSonic technology with a maximum power of 680 W. Vacuums all kinds of dirt and keeps your home always clean by maximizing its 26 kPa of suction pressure\u00b2.- It has a digital screen where you can see the remaining battery percentage, select the different modes, alerts and recommendations. And you can also view the suction level in each mode. - The Smart Auto Mode is included, which intelligently manages the suction power by adapting to the type of brush, surface (hard floor or carpet) and amount of dirt. Using sensors and automatically, the vacuum cleaner detects the appropriate power in each situation.- Guarantee maximum efficiency with the Multiphasic System.- With its ErgoFlex system it adapts to any circumstance. Thanks to its flexible tube you can access any corner. In addition, you can scrub your home thanks to the WaterTank accessory.- 2500 mAh and 29.6 V Lithium-Ion battery that achieves a range of up to 75 minutes\u00b3. You can vacuum your entire house without having to recharge it.- Four operating modes, Eco, Medium, Turbo and Auto, to adapt its use to each circumstance. The Eco mode extends the battery to the maximum with impeccable results, the Normal mode provides the best combination between efficiency and suction power, the Turbo mode kills the most difficult dirt and vacuums carpets. And the Auto mode, detects the amount of dirt that each place in your home has and adapts the suction to the amount of dirt.- Effective definitive brush against any soil and dirt. It combines three technologies: Microfibers that capture minute particles, Silicone that traps long hairs, and dragging blades to thoroughly clean carpets.- 360\u00ba technology to reach all corners of the home, even the highest. The weight falls on the fist to be able to lift the vacuum cleaner comfortably.- Maximum efficiency throughout its entire useful life thanks to Cyclonic System technology. It incorporates the latest advances in suction to separate the particles by centrifugal force.- High performance double filtering. The intake filter captures dirt and the exhaust filter retains tiny allergens to purify the air. - Large 600 ml capacity tank to vacuum the entire home.- Sound level of only 88 dB, much less than any other vacuum cleaner with similar power, so that it does not interrupt any moment of the day.- Designed to clean all types of surfaces, both soft and hard. - LED marker that shows the remaining battery and allows you to optimize cleaning to the maximum. - Thanks to its light weight of 3 kg you can move it freely and easily. - Includes 2 narrow and wide 2-in-1 accessories for furniture and corners.- 1.According to tests carried out in accordance with clause 5.8 of the IEC 62885-4:2020 standard.- 2.According to Cecotec internal tests.- 3.In Eco mode with the use of a non-motorized accessory.","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"Conga Rockstar 1700 Titanium ErgoWet, 680W, 230 AW, 90 min, 3 kg, 3000 mAh, 0.6L, 88dB, 2h, 29.6V","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"Cecotec","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":148.7976,"unit_price_tax":148.7976,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza","brand":"Cecotec","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/1872\/95294\/72294441\/bg\/aspirador-escoba-cecotec-conga-rockstar-1700-titanium-ergowet.jpg"],"wholesale_price":142.88}}},"4710474831326":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean1