en, and Proof.- Handle with trim and stainless steel materials.- Door with 5 layers and high resistance double glass that helps to maintain the temperature.- Includes frying basket, oven rack, rotisserie, rotisserie handle, pizza stone, oven mitts and grease tray.- Convection cooks evenly with the air that surrounds the food, achieving more tender and tasty results.- High-end kitchen design.- The surface reaches a low temperature level, thus achieving a much safer and less harmful use.- Equipped with interior light that helps you control the state of cooking.- Adjustable temperature up to 230 \u00baC.- Height adjustment in 3 levels to place the tray where you need each food. - Light indicator of operation","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/5603\/105519\/73235624\/bg\/hornillo-bake&fry-3000-touch-steel.jpg","wholesale_price":"111.06","unit_price_tax":116.3412},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435484022583"],"reference":"CO28330066","name":{"1":"HORNILLO BAKE&FRY 3000 TOUCH STEEL","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Hot air fryer oven, with convection, 30 liter capacity and 1600 W of power.- Tabletop oven with a capacity of 30 L. Compact size, suitable for introducing a whole chicken or turkey.- The power of air frying in an oven. Get foods with characteristics similar to those fried and with hardly any fat.- 1600 W of power for high performance.- Big touch screen. Quickly select any function on the menu with a simple touch. - 9 preset functions: Air Fry, Dehydrate, Pizza, Keep Warm, Toast, Broil, Bake, Roast Chicken, and Proof.- Handle with trim and stainless steel materials.- Door with 5 layers and high resistance double glass that helps to maintain the temperature.- Includes frying basket, oven rack, rotisserie, rotisserie handle, pizza stone, oven mitts and grease tray.- Convection cooks evenly with the air that surrounds the food, achieving more tender and tasty results.- High-end kitchen design.- The surface reaches a low temperature level,