ores ultravivos e im\u00e1genes ultrafluidas, \u00a1y prep\u00e1rate para explorar los mundos de tu imaginaci\u00f3n!","images":"https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/151\/105673\/88527386\/bg\/portatil-asus-vivobook-k3605zf-mb465-i5-12500h-16gb-512gb-rtx2050-16--fdos.jpg","wholesale_price":"678.21","unit_price_tax":694.8342},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4711387551677"],"reference":"PT041781365","name":{"1":"PORTATIL ASUS VIVOBOOK K3605ZF-MB465 I5-12500H 16GB 512GB RTX2050 16\" FDOS","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"Libera tu imaginaci\u00f3n\u00a1Da rienda suelta a tu imaginaci\u00f3n con el potente Vivobook 16X! Ya sea para trabajos creativos o para divertirte jugando, el procesador Intel y la GPU NVIDIA para port\u00e1tiles te ofrecen toda la potencia multitarea que necesitas, con un MUX Switch que te permite controlar por completo el rendimiento gr\u00e1fico. Dale un capricho a tus ojos con la impresionante pantalla NanoEdge, que ofrece colores ultravivos e im\u00e1genes ultrafluidas, \u00a1y prep\u00e1rate para explorar los mundos de tu imaginaci\u00f3n!","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"Intel Core i5-12500H (18MB Cache), 16GB DDR4-SDRAM, 512GB SSD, 40.6 cm (16\") WUXGA 1920 x 1200, Intel Iris Xe Graphics, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2050 (4GB GDDR6), WLAN, Webcam, No OS","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ASUS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":null,"unit_price":694.8342,"unit_price_tax":694.8342,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Port\u00e1tiles","brand":"ASUS","quantity":0,"images":["https:\/\/www.dmi.es\/photo\/151\/105673\/88527386\/bg\/portatil-asus-vivobook-k3605zf-mb465-i5-12500h-16gb-512gb-rtx2050-16--fdos.jpg"],"wholesale_price":678.21}}},"8435484071550":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report